    "Lot of Fortune was approximated geometrically because the installed fonts in this workspace did not expose U+1F774.",
    "v2 correction: angle placeholders replaced with compact calligraphic astrology glyphs; mean/true node now use the actual node symbol with M/T modifiers; occultation and lunar eclipse now use filled conjunction/opposition constructions matching U+1F775/U+1F776.",
    "v3 fixed duplicate pairs for East Point vs Equatorial Ascendant and Occultation vs Solar Eclipse."
